ces/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"labor":[{"year":2036,"text":"Split labor market: augmented professions pull ahead, exposed ones hollow; geography and sector decide who feels which future.","cites":["concepts/ai-displacement-vs-augmentation"]},{"year":2056,"text":"Work as identity loosens: dividend schemes, contribution economies, and the post-work constitution debates.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption"]}],"law":[{"year":2036,"text":"Patchwork doctrine: state laws multiply, preemption contested, copyright settled into licensing, liability migrating from disclosure to outcomes.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","analysis/eu-vs-us-ai-regulation"]},{"year":2051,"text":"Personhood at the bar: digital minds, AI counsel, and liability for autonomous systems define the mid-century docket.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"geopolitics":[{"year":2056,"text":"Power follows compute and its energy; the map of capability is the map of leverage.","cites":["concepts/compute-governance"]}],"public":[{"year":2036,"text":"Backlash governs: anti-AI coalitions win real elections; siting, schooling and surveillance fights set the tone.","cites":["concepts/ai-backlash"]},{"year":2056,"text":"A generation raised with minds-on-tap; the meaning politics the far field keeps on the table.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]}],"science":[{"year":2041,"text":"Steady instruments: AI as superb lab tooling inside human-paced science.","cites":["sources/ai-as-normal-technology"]},{"year":2066,"text":"The frontier is nonhuman: discovery outpaces comprehension, and translation becomes its own discipline.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"climate":[{"year":2036,"text":"The power bill arrives: AI load grows toward hundreds of TWh; gas bridges, nuclear restarts, and grid politics decide the emissions path.","cites":["industries/energy","concepts/compute-governance"]},{"year":2066,"text":"Climate outcomes track governance more than compute: the decisive variable was always deployment speed of what the science found.","cites":["industries/energy"]}]}}